          "source": "thm-qftx-gaga-analytic-projective-dolbeault-scalar-cohomology",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For every $q\\ge0$, the canonical comparison induced by the smooth Dolbeault resolution is an isomorphism $$H^q(X,\\mathcal O(E))\\cong H^q_{\\bar\\partial}(X,E).$$ ",
